WEBVTT

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:06.920
Io Nitta.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.630
Tomorrow... you'll die for us.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.740
Huh?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.770
You'll be the trump card against
tomorrow's Septentrion, Lugh.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.900
You're the only one compatible
for its possession.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.430
There is

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.900
no chance of survival.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.260
If I become a sacrifice...

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:33.740
No!

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:36.520
Will everyone else be saved?

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.050
That's right.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.400
I'll send for you tomorrow.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.650
Today, rest well.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.550
I tried making breakfast.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.780
Why? Wait, you went outside?

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.640
Being given this chance,

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:15.370
I wanted to study various
different humans.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:18.330
Are you really a Septentrion?

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.210
Please, come. Eat.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:22.980
Um...

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:25.520
It's delicious!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.360
Nitta!

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.860
I-It can't be.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:35.080
It's great! Like a
shockwave to my brain!

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.160
I cook, but I could never make this.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.970
It's all right, Nitta.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:43.710
I'm sure some unknown
"something" is in it.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.380
Y-Yeah.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.940
This has sparked much discussion.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.860
But it's delicious!

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.050
Just what did you put in this?

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.300
This is a sort of fun breakfast.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.470
Huh? Yeah.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.370
Let's share this with everyone!

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.810
We'll keep it a secret
that Alcor made it.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.350
That's unfortunate.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:06.940
It can't be helped, right?

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:09.440
You'll get captured and
turned into a lab rat!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:10.590
That's frightening.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:13.840
Nitta.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.600
Two more days.

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.240
If we hold out two days,
the war will be over.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.600
Yes.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.160
Let's survive.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.640
If we do, I'm sure there'll be hope.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:25.750
Yes.

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:28.840
Thank you. Let's do our best.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.420
What gives, you two?

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.780
I'm gonna do my best, too!

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:46.020
Alcor? You serve no use. Go away.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:48.020
But I came to see you.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.840
What can come of it now?

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.570
Yamato. Mizar will be here soon.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:55.940
You're fine with this
way of doing things?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.990
You mean, summoning Lugh?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.850
I mean Io Nitta.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:05.160
Fragile human flesh can't withstand
being possessed by a Majin.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.830
She will die.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.230
She need only last for
the battle's duration.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:14.090
Still, to think you've taken
an interest in individuals...

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:15.500
It's strange.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.900
It is.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:20.480
Even I find it unusual to
have had these feelings.

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.220
What are you planning?

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:24.500
Nothing.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:28.420
However, I'm anguished they'll
probably be saddened.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.150
"They"?

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.040
Hibiki.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.190
He's different from you.

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.130
I think he can't overcome
the death of his friends.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.030
His friends?

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:41.200
Such things are meaningless.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:43.770
How sad.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.610
Continue to anguish alone.

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:47.800
For eternity.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.860
Alone, eh?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.110
There is no anguish if
you abandon emotion.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.030
Like you?

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.580
Shut your mouth.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.870
And what becomes of me should I do that?

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:02.140
Who knows?

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:05.870
If you can't decide for yourself,
just leave everything to me.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.870
That will do.

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.100
It's time.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.080
Okay.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.820
It's here, huh? What is it this time?

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.700
Mizar manifestation readings increasing.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.540
It's appearing in Tokyo.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.430
Here, huh?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.270
Daichi, where's Nitta?

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.830
Huh? She's not with you?

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.300
No.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:05:00.130
The Septentrion Mizar will launch
a direct attack on Tokyo's barrier.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.070
It's got another tough power, right?

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.760
What can it do?

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.410
Unlimited replication.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:07.540
Huh? Unlim--

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.630
Once it appears, it will
copy itself forever.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:12.830
How are we supposed to beat that?!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.590
We attack it forever.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:15.840
That's impossible, ain't it?!

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:16.980
Don't lose hope.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.170
Mizar's attacks can be predicted.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.800
There's no change to the plan.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.840
Plan?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.490
Nobody told me about that!

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.700
You all are unnecessary.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.660
Yamato! Where did you take Nitta?

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.670
Watch and be silent.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.280
Preparations complete here.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.070
Nitta!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:51.660
Pulse, heart rate, summoning
coefficient are all normal.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.960
I'm shocked.

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:55.810
You really are the
perfect vessel for Lugh.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.570
As if that's what you were born for.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.300
Words of comfort would
be meaningless, huh?

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.640
Yes.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:05.800
Then I'll say none.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:10.070
Considering our plight, this plan has
the highest possibility of success.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.060
It's the only way we have left.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.330
So, die for everyone.

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.180
For everyone...

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:16.750
Yes.

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:20.160
Okay.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.920
So, in other words...

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.010
She's just a sacrifice!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.570
That's right.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:27.850
No way!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.930
She'll be okay, like we were, right?

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:34.020
Possession means offering
one's body to a demon.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.600
There are no guarantees.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.860
That ain't good, is it?!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.300
Nitta!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.920
Hey, you! Who do you think you are?

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.540
Cut it out now and get
away from that machine!

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.530
We can go right now!

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:49.760
It doesn't matter if it replicates
endlessly if we can take it out.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:50.640
Right?!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:51.370
That's right!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.910
There's no other way?

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:58.460
Yamato, stop this now. I'll go!

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.020
Meaningless.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:03.170
The enemy is a Septentrion
that replicates endlessly.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:06.030
Both your Byakko and
my Cerberus will at

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.510
some point run out of energy.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.610
Then look for some other way!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:13.040
While we do that, Mizar will
envelop the world's surface

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.390
and everyone will die.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.250
Manifestation readings increasing!

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.650
Mizar is appearing in Ikebukuro!

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:35.160
Begin the situation. Summon Lugh.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.520
No.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:46.550
No!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.180
Lugh summoning has commenced!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.600
Magical power supplied from
Ryumyaku has stabilized.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.430
Lugh is appearing!

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.550
Nitta!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.350
A friend's dead face clip has arrived!

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.550
Hibiki?

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.050
Io Nitta's Lugh possession is complete.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.010
It hurts!

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.520
160 seconds until Io
Nitta's mind collapses.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.550
Stop it! Please, stop!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.070
Wh-What the?!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.380
We know it's unjust.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.690
But there's no going back now.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.820
Please, just accept this.

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:56.540
130 seconds until Io
Nitta's mind collapses!

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.790
Activate Lugh control device.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.570
Lugh control device connected.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:07.150
Mental link was a success.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:08.440
Do it.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.520
Lugh.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.980
Release the power of Ryumyaku!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.270
What is that?

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.490
The form that Japan's
Ryumyaku has manifested:

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.810
The Ryumyaku dragon, Shakko.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.880
The trump card reserved to combat Mizar.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.530
60 seconds until Io
Nitta's mind collapses!

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:55.390
That's enough. O dragon, consume all.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:01.480
Mizar's replication rate will
soon exceed maximum speed

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:03.660
and consume our universe.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.610
At present, we have no
physical means to contain it.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:11.220
Our only hope is to have it
consumed and isolated by Shakko,

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:12.840
which connects to a different universe.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.380
Lugh and Io Nitta are Shakko's
"control terminal,"

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.910
unable to be replaced or reloaded.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:19.310
It's single-use only.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.870
30 seconds until Io
Nitta's mind collapses!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.210
Nitta!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:37.720
10 seconds to mental collapse!

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:44.940
It's finished.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:56.760
M-Mizar has been destroyed.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.370
The plan was a success!

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:00.830
For now.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:16.130
Io Nitta's mind has collapsed.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.700
Destruction of self-awareness confirmed.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.310
It can't be! Nitta...

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.000
You all!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:35.170
Nitta. Well done.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.010
Nitta!

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:49.520
Kuze! You okay?

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.150
Nitta is...!

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:56.090
Io Nitta has no mental readings.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.340
She's been completely
overtaken by the demon Lugh.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.990
Kuze. She's...

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.010
No way!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:04.770
Hibiki.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.250
That is Lugh.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.420
Kill it.

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.040
So I'm finally released? How detestable.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.580
You have dealt a blow
indeed, feeble human...

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.900
Descendant of the Hotsuin.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:36.130
This is the first time
we've directly met...

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:37.970
Lugh of the Long Arm.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:42.670
To think, you would place a god in
a prison, even treat it as a tool.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.520
You are fiends.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:46.160
What of it?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:49.420
Going forward, the chosen humans
will have no need for gods.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.960
Now then, my apologies so
soon after your awakening,

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:57.910
but that frail body won't be
able to sustain your existence.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.780
You have minutes, maybe.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:00.860
Don't resist.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.600
I'll easily kill you.

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:04.740
A few minutes will be enough.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:08.790
I will teach you what happens
to fools who ridicule a god.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.510
Nitta!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.630
Lugh is heading this way!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.590
Is it mad? Well, of course.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.490
Hibiki, you can hear me?

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.590
You will defeat Lugh.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.200
Stop it, Yamato!

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:26.890
Shijima.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:30.300
I don't recall giving you
permission to enter here.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.920
That's Nitta, right?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.400
What are you saying?!

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:35.750
Those who can do nothing should shut up.

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:38.900
Is being able to do nothing so bad?

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.220
How stuck-up can you be?!

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.600
Did Nitta say she was fine with this?

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.760
She wouldn't say that, would she?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.680
She's timid, so you pushed
her into it, didn't ya?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.270
We had her consent.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.500
It's even in writing.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.580
You all...!

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:56.590
This is something humans do?!

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:58.550
Makoto!

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:01.730
What did you make that girl do?!

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.660
The situation has changed.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.560
Personal feelings must be put
aside for the greater good.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:11.870
You all are deciding
who lives and who dies!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:16.190
You're just thinking of
yourselves, aren't you?!

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:17.720
Stop whining, Shijima.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.360
Shut up, you bastard!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.070
Dammit!

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.600
Why? Why Nitta?!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.500
She forced herself to do
what scared her the most!

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.380
Like, "I've gotta push
on," and forced herself.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:41.820
Why did you have to make a
girl like that a sacrifice?!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.890
Lugh is approaching!

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.310
Nitta!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:09.530
Hotsuin.

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:13.700
You've tried to survive
by disgracing a god...

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.900
Know the gravity of your sin!

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:22.940
Nitta!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:23.760
Stop it!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:26.310
Those are good demons.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:29.720
You would seem to be a good
magician, for a human.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.160
Are you really not Nitta?

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.890
Please, give Nitta back!

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.290
Impossible.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.880
This girl's spirit is
returned to the Void.

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.340
Her body will soon collapse as well.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.030
Because you were made to possess her!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.670
That's right.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.000
It may have been instigated,

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:51.030
but in the end, she chose
to offer up her life.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.290
"Chose"? Nitta did?

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.540
I heard her final cries of despair.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.920
She was a weak-spirited girl.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:03.670
This girl's body will soon be destroyed.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:05.690
And this world as well.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:10.050
How shall you act in the
face of such despair?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:20.690
Yamato!

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:22.270
Why do you hesitate?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:26.620
Hibiki, I was awaiting your readiness.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.530
How unfortunate.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:29.360
Baal.

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:32.830
Kill her.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.370
No, Yamato! Suzaku!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.380
Stop it!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:55.640
Byakko!

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:10.890
Nitta!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:13.820
Hibiki, damn you.

00:17:13.820 --> 00:17:15.680
Don't you hurt Nitta!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:18.660
Io Nitta is dead. Lose
such naïve thoughts!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.430
I WILL protect her.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.920
That's what I promised!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.430
Humans are foolish in any age.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.080
It seems this body will
soon reach its limit.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.600
Mr. Hotsuin, you alone shall be judged.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.360
Hibiki!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.850
Hibiki. Damn you.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:01.850
What is going on?

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.040
Ryumyaku's magical power is surging!

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:05.230
The chief?

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:05.750
No!

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:07.280
It's Hibiki Kuze.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:08.050
What?

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:09.380
Hibiki!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:18.060
I see. So that's it.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:22.150
Shakko... The dragon chose Hibiki, eh?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.810
Interesting.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.130
I'm surprised.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.450
I never thought he really had
the same qualities as Yamato.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:34.230
Sure enough, you bear
the same karma as I.

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:36.350
You are one who will guide the world.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.540
Hibiki, take my hand.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.880
I thought I told you...

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:51.630
I will use my power to
protect other people!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.780
Magical power supply from Ryumyaku
is increasing even more!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.870
Not good. There's no
way he can stand it.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.890
Seal the flow from Ryumyaku!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.490
Control is impossible!

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.770
H-How should we handle this?

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:04.980
Don't interfere!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.210
Nitta!

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.470
I told you, it's impossible.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:17.360
No matter how much you try to stop it!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:19.350
It's not impossible.

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.190
I won't let it be impossible!

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.200
A girl named Io Nitta was here!

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:28.830
Nitta isn't gone. I know it.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:32.960
I mean, you're still here!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.700
No!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.540
Nitta, please...

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:53.530
Don't choose death!

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:56.180
I have to do what I can do.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:59.090
I mean, I have to!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.740
There's no other choice.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:05.080
But not death. I can't accept that!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:09.100
But, I... I'm not as strong
as the rest of you.

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.510
Holding it in...

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.410
pretending it's no big deal...

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.760
It hurts so much!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.700
In a world without my
mother and father...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.120
What should I do?

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:25.250
Doing my best is just impossible.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:29.120
I can't live, being strong
like everyone else.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.230
It's okay to be weak!

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:33.380
Everybody's weak.

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:35.920
That's why we rely on others.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.060
We live by helping one another!

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:40.410
We can say, we need one another.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:45.410
I've been able to survive because
I have you and the others!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.720
No! Hibiki, you're so strong!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.170
You don't need me. Even
without me, you'd--

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.510
I don't want to lose you!

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.220
So, I'll help you.

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.800
Let's survive together. Io!

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:05.800
Hibiki.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:33.130
It's... okay for me to live?

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:38.630
Of course. I won't let you choose death.

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:43.590
I... I want to live.

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:45.260
I know.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:47.070
I know that.

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:49.430
You don't have to worry.

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:59.300
A miracle, eh?

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.640
We will survive.

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:15.230
Hibiki!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:20.270
Do not underestimate Ryumyaku's power.

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:22.900
Hibiki's body is by now in tatters.

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:27.030
Come collect him. He's half-dead by now.

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:29.970
We won't kill him.

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:35.500
We'll use all the medical
magic JP's has, make him live.

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:38.250
Because he is mine.

00:23:42.820 --> 00:23:44.740
This terrible battle...

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:47.080
It will be over tomorrow, right?

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.070
That's right.

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:50.930
If you live, you can see
it with your own eyes:

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:52.930
the future that's about to begin.

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:55.270
I won't follow you.

00:23:55.540 --> 00:23:59.100
I... I'm moving forward with Hibiki!

00:23:59.340 --> 00:24:00.500
I care not.

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:04.160
Even if I must fight you
all, it will be a trial

00:24:04.160 --> 00:24:07.410
needed for humanity to evolve.

00:24:08.340 --> 00:24:11.910
When that happens, I'll use
all my power to kill you.
